{"v":4,"catch":"根據圓圈中的數字畫出盡可能多的連接線。","desc":"\"Hashiwokakero \"是一個謎題，其中的數字就像島嶼，你在其中畫線，就像橋樑。你必須考慮到整個棋盤的情況，同時要逐塊前進。你確實需要注意這個謎題，但它可以被順利和很好地解決。\n\n選項菜單、手冊和其他文本都有日語、英語、法語、德語、意大利語和西班牙語版本。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-02-09","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","派對","訓練"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c3831556c027b302eedbd31ff5c464ff69e3d027129d6f1909e6be2054c5046f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f48b9aa66e9443d139c49770213a241cdc1de5f23480ca863b0c12a3eb062b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/143d22cda0233a05cdd0ef4cb92bcacffb4e13c7c996f91974ba33bbb7e69446.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2c20124db87939125f7eb4526bea9e9d92127e38f1aaf4277ee4296ab16a8c07.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/08d3a411b437a0438d4149aabfa6d484b35a12ccd3c735a1024eaf14126364e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/261a3f084d26fdf9ddca94a504a007164cd50c9026b09748a789c9650cd5bf4b.jpg"],"titleId":"010017100e98a000","dlc":[]}